  DisplayName: Occult Librarian
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: Hours spent reading numerous compendiums dedicated to various occult
    topics honed your knowledge of these more obscure magical arts. You might have
    taken to adventuring to finance your acquisition of rare tomes, to explore occult
    mysteries that can't be found in the pages of a book, or perhaps to put your
    skills to the test. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Intelligence
    or Wisdom , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained in the Occultism
    skill and the Academia Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Schooled
    in Secrets] skill feat.
